recommend keep-going Voucher r2 (the attestation travels as a format voucher-v1 Bron record, byte-for-byte round-trip, still verifying offline), then r3 across a Knot and r4 true to the bytes (app == awk over a real fixture, order-head recomputed matches the signed one). A served voucher · per-account mint authority · breach renames (cairn-first) · deep debride · seed force-push stay the maintainer's hand.
